      "end": 662.29,
      "en": "What's your problem?",
      "zh": "你有什么毛病？"
    },
    {
      "id": 225,
      "start": 663.12,
      "end": 665.92,
      "en": "Geez, having a fit is not going to help.",
      "zh": "发脾气也没用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 226,
      "start": 666.05,
      "end": 667.29,
      "en": "Here, I know a shortcut.",
      "zh": "这儿有条近路。"
    },
    {
      "id": 227,
      "start": 668.2,
      "end": 671.68,
      "en": "Let's go down here and we'll cut through Ashburn Heights.",
      "zh": "我们从这里走，穿过阿什本高地。"
    },
    {
      "id": 228,
      "start": 671.68,
      "end": 672.47,
      "en": "Let's go, let's go.",
      "zh": "走吧，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 229,
      "start": 673.36,
      "end": 673.81,
      "en": "Watch out for that lady.",
      "zh": "小心那位女士。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 674.37,
      "end": 675.97,
      "en": "I'm going as fast as I can.",
      "zh": "我已经开到最快了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 679.75,
      "end": 680.73,
      "en": "Yes, we made it.",
      "zh": "太好了，我们成功了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 681.17,
      "end": 682.89,
      "en": "5.58 just before the library closes.",
      "zh": "5 点 58 分，刚好赶在图书馆关门前。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 683.71,
      "end": 684.77,
      "en": "You're such a geek.",
      "zh": "你真是个书呆子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 688.72,
      "end": 690.88,
      "en": "Well this dialogue is all about driving, right?",
      "zh": "好吧，这个对话都是关于驾驶的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 691.48,
      "end": 692.48,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 692.48,
      "end": 697.18,
      "en": "In North America, where both of us are from, driving is everything.",
      "zh": "在我们俩来自的北美，开车就是一切。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 698.68,
      "end": 700.04,
      "en": "Everybody has a car.",
      "zh": "每个人都有一辆车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 700.04,
      "end": 700.62,
      "en": "When did you get a car?",
      "zh": "你什么时候买的车？"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 702.64,
      "end": 705.14,
      "en": "My car I got when I was like maybe 19.",
      "zh": "我可能19岁的时候买的车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 705.68,
      "end": 705.88,
      "en": "Really?",
      "zh": "真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 706.24,
      "end": 709.18,
      "en": "But I learned how to drive and I was driving already by the age of 16.",
      "zh": "但我学会了如何开车，到了 16 岁时我已经开车了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 709.66,
      "end": 710.3,
      "en": "Yeah, that's the thing.",
      "zh": "是的，事情就是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 710.52,
      "end": 719.82,
      "en": "In many countries you have to wait until I think you're 18 to drive, but in North America everyone has a driver's license by the time they're 16 years old.",
      "zh": "在许多国家，你必须等到我认为你 18 岁才能开车，但在北美，每个人都在 16 岁时拥有驾驶执照。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 720.12,
      "end": 720.66,
      "en": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "zh": "对，对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 720.98,
      "end": 723.81,
      "en": "I guess everything is so far away that you need a car.",
      "zh": "我想一切都很远，你需要一辆车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 724.04,
      "end": 729.72,
      "en": "Yeah, it's a lot less likely to have subways or trains to travel by in North America.",
      "zh": "是的，在北美有地铁或火车旅行的可能性要小得多。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 729.95,
      "end": 736.35,
      "en": "All right, so now you have all the tools necessary to give directions the next time you're in a car or in a taxi.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以现在你有了下次在车里或出租车上时指示方向的所有工具。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 736.88,
      "end": 739.25,
      "en": "Well everyone, I really hope you enjoyed this lesson.",
      "zh": "好吧，大家，我真的希望你们喜欢这节课。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 739.4,
      "end": 751.52,
      "en": "Now I want to remind you all to come to our EnglishPod website at EnglishPod.com and here you'll find a lot of tools to help you understand our podcasts better.",
      "zh": "现在我想提醒大家访问我们的英语pod网站englishpod.com，在这里你会找到很多工具来帮助你更好地理解我们的播客。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 751.52,
      "end": 755.0,
      "en": "So with that, until next time, this is goodbye.",
      "zh": "所以，直到下一次，这是再见。"
    }
  ],
